udaism and Jewish history, and other interpretations of \"messiah\" that shed new light on what it means to usher in the \"kingdom of God.\" This book is our call to see ourselves as the fulfillment of, not the anticipators of, messianic change.\".\n\n\"Drawing from the Bible, the Talmud, rabbinic sources, and modern-day scholars, Rabbi Robert Levine provides us with an accessible, fascinating understanding of messianic vision, as well as false messiahs throughout Jewish history. He challenges the powerful idea of messiah that has survived in the heart, soul, and ethos of the Jewish people, and reveals the immediacy of the messianic presence in our day - in our own lives.\"--BOOK JACKET."},"latest_revision":11,"revision":11,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-30T08:14:56.482104"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-09-07T22:46:08.497966"}}},"ISBN:9781580232555":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781580232555","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL8779292M/There_Is_No_Messiah_and_You're_It","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL8779292M/There_Is_No_Messiah_and_You're_It","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/839716-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Jewish Lights Publishing"],"number_of_pages":170,"subtitle":"The Stunning Transformation Of Judaism's Most Provocative Idea","weight":"7.2 ounces","covers":[839716],"physical_format":"Paperback","key":"/books/OL8779292M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL448155A","name":"Robert N. Levine"}],"subjects":["Judaism","Religion - Judaism","Religion","Judaism - General","Spirituality - General","Judaism - History"],"edition_name":"New Ed edition","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"title":"There Is No Messiah and You're It","identifiers":{"goodreads":["2272752"],"librarything":["391317"]},"isbn_13":["9781580232555"],"isbn_10":["1580232558"],"publish_date":"February 15, 2005","works":[{"key":"/works/OL2939056W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"physical_dimensions":"8